    <h1>Investor Personality Quiz</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Answer a few quick questions and get matched to one of 40 US stock portfolio types built from QQQ, SPY &amp; SCHD</p>
    <div class="cta-group">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="https://ezlong.com/stock-personality-quiz.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Tool &rarr;</a>
      <a class="btn-secondary" href="https://ezlong.com/en/">Browse All Tools</a>
    </div>
    <p class="auto-translate-note">Tool UI is in Korean &mdash; Chrome, Edge &amp; Safari auto-translate automatically.</p>
  </section>
