      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="cta-card">
      <h2>Find Your Investor Type Now</h2>
      <p>Free, no sign-up, takes about 3 minutes. Chrome auto-translates Korean to English.</p>
      <a class="btn-white" href="https://ezlong.com/stock-personality-quiz.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Take the Quiz &rarr;</a>
    </div>
